# Code owners. The main-branch ruleset (issue #30) requires a pull-request review; with
# three owners listed on every line, its require_code_owner_review can be set to true so
# that review has to come from one of them.
#
# The release path (the updater, the installer, lib/, ui/, the workflows, the
# release tooling and the maintainer key directory) is listed separately so the
# owners of each line can change independently; the ruleset sets how many
# approvals a pull request needs. tools/tests/ci_pins_test.sh requires at least
# two owners on every release-path line.

*                           @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain

/update-scripts.sh          @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/install.sh                 @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/lib/                       @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/lib/release-keys/          @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/lib/wgvpn/peers/ssh/       @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/ui/                        @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/.github/                   @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/tools/release-scripts.sh   @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/tools/cut-release.sh       @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/MANIFEST                   @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/MANIFEST.asc               @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
/RELEASE                    @grantkee @sstanfield @MavenRain
